+# nrlink v7: 8 KB main stack instead of the 2 KB default. Under host->controller load the UART receive path, the
+# RPMsg send and nested interrupts (UART, NBU messages, SysTick) overran 2 KB in this -O0 build; the overflow runs
+# below RAM, the fault handler faults on the same stack and the core locks up (board silent, no report).
+mcux_add_configuration(
+    LD "-Xlinker --defsym=__stack_size__=0x2000"
